# Random string of at least 32 characters, for example from a password manager or `openssl rand -hex 32`.
# It is the password of the /setup page and the source of the key that encrypts the stored credentials;
# changing it later means running the setup again.
SELUNA_SECRET=
# Optional. Without it, enter the token of your Telegram bot in the setup wizard (step Telegram chat): talk to
# @BotFather in Telegram, send /newbot and copy the token it returns. When set, this Worker secret takes precedence
# over a token saved in the setup.
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
